WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:45.770
﻿Either guided by the self-defense instinct
﻿of the eggs of the giant Doumou creatures,

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.480
Or by the cries of Cosmo and the others...

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.280
﻿No one knows.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:53.780
﻿The Ideon Gauge suddenly powered up,

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:57.420
﻿and wiped out the pursuing Buff
﻿Clan forces with a single blow.

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:12.890
<b>Emerging from Darkness</b>

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.150
Do you know that planet?

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:55.970
There's no planet we don't know,
 save for remote ones like your Earth.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.800
﻿It's easy to defend, and hard to attack. Night Star.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.660
﻿What should we do?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.730
Oh, sorry to bother you...

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.960
I don't mind. What is it?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.680
Look at these pictures taken from a microscope.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.140
Is it the Ideonite?

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:24.240
﻿Yes.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.240
So you don't know what this glowing component is?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:28.410
﻿Here.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:29.260
﻿Thank you.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:33.750
These shining parts on the highly pure particles...

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:37.290
are the secret behind the metal that
 the Ideon ﻿and Solo Ship are made of.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.550
Is it the Ide itself?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:45.440
﻿No, could it be the system that seals
 the Ide in, and emits the energy outside?

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.550
It's possible.

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:51.140
﻿But even if the Ideonite is destroyed,
﻿the power won't decrease.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.480
How do you explain that?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:59.410
The consciousnesses once contained in the Ideonite somehow become independent... Is that it?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.060
﻿Yes.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:05.070
It even has an automatic self-development system.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.970
Does that mean...

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.640
﻿The Ide's influence only keeps growing?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.250
That's right.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.720
Doesn't that make it impossible to control?

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.320
The Ide might be toying around with us.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.080
﻿I don't want to think about it.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.720
﻿It's below this satellite.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:35.650
We'll lure the Logo Dau aliens' ship to this Point X...

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:38.900
and fire sublight missiles at the satellite.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.500
﻿So you're saying the Solo
﻿Ship won't stand a chance?

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:49.600
﻿But won't the falling debris
 severely damage the Night Star?

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.420
It doesn't matter.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:55.750
﻿I want to make sure whether this
 infinite energy exists or not.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.650
That's the plan.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.270
I shall lure out the Giant.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:04.350
Either that, or I'll show you the
 noble death of a Buff Clan samurai.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:11.880
﻿Sorry!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.510
His diaper is wet. I'll get it changed.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:16.650
Thanks!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.690
﻿Hey, you've got to keep on studying!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:21.850
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.120
There there, you'll feel better right away!

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.970
﻿Karala's been energetic lately.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.680
She's like a mother.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:30.840
﻿Deck, get to your studying!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.270
Are we really heading into
 this tightly packed stardust?

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.440
﻿We can do it. If you look close,
 there's plenty of space.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.320
I'm detecting unidentified electronic ﻿waves.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.820
﻿Is it the Logo Dau aliens?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.420
There shouldn't be anything
 else emitting those waves...

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.200
﻿Let's begin!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:07.820
Enemy units!

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:09.590
﻿All hands, get ready for battle!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.220
﻿Lotta!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.790
Let's take the kids to ﻿the middle of the ship!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:12.640
Take care of Lou!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.570
﻿Yes! Lou!

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:14.770
﻿Hurry!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.310
They found us even on a star like this!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.850
Why is that?

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.000
Maybe the Ideon told them we're here?

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:24.750
﻿Wait!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:31.610
﻿I'll be back!

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.150
﻿Gije!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.040
﻿You're late!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:36.710
﻿Sorry.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.910
Are there many of them?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:39.870
Only one unit.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:40.790
﻿One unit?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:44.180
Don't you think that's unusual for the Buff Clan?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:45.680
You're right...

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:49.330
These could be the survivors ﻿from Doumou Star...

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.550
﻿You're too naive.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.180
﻿I bet a huge squad is going to follow.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:54.710
﻿You think so?

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:01.600
Shouldn't we line up vertically?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.360
Why's that, Deck?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.860
It's easier to spot approaching enemies that way.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.400
Good thinking.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.560
﻿I've been studying!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.580
﻿Hannibal has encountered the Ideon!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.670
﻿And the sublight missiles?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.890
﻿They've entered the course.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.470
Will the Ideon take the bait?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.550
﻿The Solo Ship's crew has won
 against impossible odds.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:36.460
That has made them too confident,
 and they believe they cannot lose.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.180
﻿Yes.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:42.170
If we had infinite power, we'd
 probably feel that way ourselves.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:46.660
That excessive self confidence is their weak point.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.770
Too much confidence will
 create flaws in their thinking.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.450
﻿Puffers, prepare to launch!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.440
We're going after them!

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.340
That's right, follow me!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.300
﻿This guy's fast!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:34.820
﻿With all these rocks around, the radar's useless!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.410
We'd better be careful!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.070
This might be a decoy plan!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.070
﻿Deck, pay attention to our surroundings.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.490
﻿Damn!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.540
They're so fast!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.760
I've already fought you once,
 I know what you're capable of!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.930
Where did he go?

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:11.230
They started the battle, but
 now they're running away?

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:14.190
We probably shouldn't chase
them too far. What do you think?

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.770
You want us to pull back after he's made fun of us?

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:23.110
﻿Damn you!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.050
﻿Bes!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.300
﻿What's their number?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.790
﻿It appears to be two Heavy Mobile Mecha.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.710
Don't you think Cosmo and the
﻿ others are getting a bit carried away?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.260
Yes, probably.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.770
But in this stardust, the radar is nigh useless.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.630
﻿No, we've caught something on the radar...

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:48.850
Enemy units at 6 o'clock!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.190
﻿Ready our anti-aircraft fire!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.380
﻿Launch the Solo Ship!

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:53.890
﻿Wait, Bes.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.070
Why?

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.150
It's the Scarabelli's fighters again!

00:09:58.150 --> 00:09:59.240
﻿The Scarabelli?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.100
Huh?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.410
﻿Puffers!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:06.860
﻿Puffers?

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.810
Now that's a flashy greeting!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.290
They're Earthlings!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:19.030
﻿Now I know how ﻿Karala must have
 felt when the Buff Clan was after her.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.350
Cruisers approaching from left ﻿and right!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.060
Normal engine functional!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.600
﻿What?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.520
﻿Is the Scarabelli behind us?

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.010
Seems like it... It's not in our sight!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.180
﻿Fire the rear missiles!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:43.360
Shoot down what you can
 before the Buff Clan arrives!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:50.500
﻿Why won't the Earth leave us alone?!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:55.220
﻿They're pitiful people tempted
 by the concept of infinite power.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.880
﻿Just like the Buff Clan.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.090
The Ide isn't that great!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.890
﻿We can’t even control it!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.650
Our own people aren't always
 as smart as we'd hope...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.400
That's right...

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:12.150
There's no choice but to attack them.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.720
We'll get killed otherwise.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.030
My power is on level with yours.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.360
﻿I'm different than Mebarul!

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:38.990
﻿Go!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.670
I'll drag you to Point X one way or another!

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.150
They got us!

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:17.500
﻿We did it!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.170
﻿Scarabelli! Can you hear me?!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.950
We're taking the Giant to Point X!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.260
﻿Force their spaceship over here quickly!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.950
﻿Roger! Thank you for your efforts!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:27.380
{GRUNT PLACEHOLDER}

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:31.510
﻿If a samurai falls in battle, his
 followers won't have any regrets.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.260
Don't let me die in vain!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.760
Don't rush to your death.

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:39.920
So that's the situation...

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:43.980
Bes! The Scarabelli has joined
 forces with the Buff Clan!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.780
Huh? Why?!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.230
Impossible!

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.710
﻿Damn, they're quick!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:58.780
Left missiles!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.960
You think you can beat us with this?

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:15.640
﻿Cosmo, the Buff Clan and
 Scarabelli have joined forces!

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.310
﻿What?!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.550
With the Buff Clan?!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.800
﻿They're pulling us! Missiles!

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:35.780
How'd we fall for such a simple attack?

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:38.360
﻿Cosmo, don't struggle against him!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.630
Karala!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:46.540
﻿What is it?

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.740
Go inside and get some rest.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:49.990
Yes...

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.130
What is it?

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.280
﻿It's alright! She's just feeling a little sick.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.150
﻿The Giant is closing in.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.350
﻿Send the signal to fire the sublight missiles!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.020
Sublight missile firing signal spotted!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.860
Give the order to ﻿fire the sublight missiles!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.520
﻿Separate!

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:20.070
Pull them!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.890
﻿Dock out!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:27.830
﻿Roger!

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.810
﻿Is Kasha going to be alright?

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.420
She can handle herself!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.960
Fire the missiles!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.050
﻿Go to hell!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:46.840
﻿The barrier!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.490
﻿The Gido Mack has vanished!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:57.730
Evacuate fast!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.280
The countdown ﻿to the sublight missiles has begun!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.330
Sublight missiles, ready to fire!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:14.920
﻿Target confirmed!

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.200
﻿The Puffers will be recovered in 30 seconds!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.450
﻿Okay! The sublight missiles are coming.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.730
All ships, continue your attack for 30 seconds more!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:48.840
﻿The fighters have retreated?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.870
Are they going to send their warships?

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.140
﻿The Scarabelli's cruiser is coming up!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.840
﻿Kasha! Hurry up and dock!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.300
Roger!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.920
﻿What the?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.030
﻿This is a strange tremor!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.800
﻿Okay, here it is!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.610
All ships, ﻿start your DS Drive immediately!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.710
Hannibal Gen...

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:35.060
Your noble death won't be in vain.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.210
﻿What?!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.450
﻿Meteorites!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.550
﻿The stardust!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.250
The moon is falling!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.580
﻿Barrier output to maximum!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.120
﻿Engine, full power!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.360
I don't care if it overheats!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:09.590
Lou!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.630
﻿Lou, it's dangerous.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.880
Let's take everyone deeper inside.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.200
﻿Yes. Come, Ashura, Fard!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.100
﻿Kasha, Gije!

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:31.230
﻿The Ideon Swords...

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.380
﻿We must guard the Solo Ship ﻿with the Ideon Swords!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:35.090
﻿The swords have powered up already!

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:36.010
﻿What?!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.500
What is this?

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.740
Can't we control this?!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.560
Is this...

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.460
﻿A manifestation of the Ide's power?!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.210
The Solo Ship...

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.960
﻿Did the Solo Ship get crushed?

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.980
﻿No way, that couldn't have happened!

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.550
﻿Bes... Sheryl... Lotta...

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:36.160
We've lost contact with the
 cruiser that held back the Ideon!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:38.390
It was inevitable.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:43.000
We took down the Solo Ship.
 Such a sacrifice was necessary.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.910
﻿What's that light?

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.530
It's coming from the Night Star!

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.370
Wh-what's this?

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.240
﻿This planet...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:02.000
Did the satellite's impact start a cataclysm?

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.010
Solo Ship... The Solo Ship is...

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.370
﻿The Solo Ship?!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:46.250
This ﻿is the power of the Ide!
 The Ide's manifestation!

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:57.680
﻿There's no doubt about it...

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.090
﻿The Solo Ship has surfaced again!

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:01.440
Yes sir!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.530
﻿Wh... What is this?!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.900
﻿It's as if that ship has the power of the devil!

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:14.620
The Ide may have taken away control from us.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.890
We musn't assume that we
 were saved by the Ide's power.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.010
﻿That's what I think.

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:28.330
﻿That's right.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:33.060
The Ide was supposed to be the
 embodiment of a righteous spirit...

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:36.950
But this devastating power
 is clearly evil. It's far too great!

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.810
So are you calling us evil?!

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:41.480
I didn't say that...

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:45.240
﻿But you said we have an evil power!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.820
﻿Yes, Kasha...

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:52.450
﻿But I still believe a righteous power
 can awaken the good in Ide.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.530
That's optimistic.

